# Reelwright requires no environment variables.
#
# The application runs entirely in the browser: scripts come from a local
# rule-based engine, narration from the device's speech voices, and video from
# the browser's own media pipeline. No API keys are requested or stored.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact, and to give a marked place to
# add configuration if you later wire in a paid provider (for example a cloud
# TTS or image API). If you do, keep the values here, never in source code,
# and never commit the resulting .env file.

# --- Example placeholders (unused) -----------------------------------------
# VITE_TTS_PROVIDER_KEY=
# VITE_IMAGE_PROVIDER_KEY=
